<title>JAPAN: Japan 4-yr note auction lowest price 99.42 - MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan 4-yr note auction lowest price 99.42 - MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>An auction of 500 billion yen in four-year government notes produced the following results, the Ministry of Finance said on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Lowest price	 99.42    Stop rate	   1.252 pct</p>
<p> Average price	99.51    Average yield     1.228 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   1.1745 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted bids	499.7  billion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 36.9491 pct</p>
<p> Issue date    Feb 20, 1997   Maturity    Feb 20, 2001</p>
<p> Coupon payment     Feb 20, Aug 20</p>
</text>
